{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a1-explainer-about-kobe-bryant-muggsy-bogues-spud-webb-and-mamba-mentality/audio/main-70058b4e39d9.mp3","durationSec":166.584,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.02,"text":"Kobe Bryant was a famous basketball player."},{"start":2.6,"end":4.76,"text":"He was born on August 23, 1978."},{"start":5.54,"end":7.36,"text":"He played for the Los Angeles Lakers."},{"start":8.2,"end":10.34,"text":"The Los Angeles Lakers are a team in the NBA."},{"start":10.98,"end":13.72,"text":"The NBA is the big basketball league in the United States."},{"start":14.74,"end":16.9,"text":"Kobe Bryant played 20 years in the NBA."},{"start":17.38,"end":21.34,"text":"He played all 20 years with the same team, the Los Angeles Lakers."},{"start":22,"end":23.9,"text":"That is a long time with one team."},{"start":24.84,"end":27.42,"text":"Kobe Bryant died on January 26, 2020."},{"start":27.94,"end":29.58,"text":"Many people still remember him."},{"start":29.58,"end":31.7,"text":"Kobe Bryant won a lot."},{"start":32.4,"end":35.28,"text":"He won five NBA championships with the Los Angeles Lakers."},{"start":36.1,"end":38.98,"text":"A championship means the team was the best team that year."},{"start":39.7,"end":41.9,"text":"In 2008, he was the NBA MVP."},{"start":42.8,"end":46.3,"text":"MVP means the most valuable player, the best player of the season."},{"start":47,"end":50.24,"text":"In 1997, he won the Slam Dunk Contest."},{"start":50.72,"end":54.26,"text":"In the Slam Dunk Contest, players jump high and try big dunks."},{"start":54.94,"end":56.56,"text":"Kobe Bryant also played for the U.S."},{"start":56.56,"end":56.9,"text":"team."},{"start":56.9,"end":61.72,"text":"He won two Olympic gold medals, in 2008 and in 2012."},{"start":61.72,"end":64.64,"text":"People called Kobe Bryant the Black Mamba."},{"start":65.6,"end":68.3,"text":"A black mamba is a fast, strong snake."},{"start":68.78,"end":70.04,"text":"The name shows how he played."},{"start":70.9,"end":73.44,"text":"From this name comes the idea of Mamba Mentality."},{"start":74.28,"end":77.54,"text":"Mamba Mentality means work hard every day and keep trying."},{"start":78.12,"end":79.76,"text":"It is not only about game day."},{"start":80.18,"end":84.9,"text":"It is about every practice, every morning, every small step."},{"start":85.34,"end":88.54,"text":"A student in a school club can use Mamba Mentality too."},{"start":89.08,"end":91.22,"text":"Come to practice every day."},{"start":91.78,"end":93.14,"text":"Try again after a miss."},{"start":93.88,"end":95.12,"text":"Get a little better each time."},{"start":95.12,"end":97.8,"text":"Basketball players are often very tall."},{"start":97.8,"end":99.44,"text":"Muggsy Bogues was not."},{"start":100.02,"end":103.58,"text":"He was about 5 feet 3 inches tall, or 1.60 meters."},{"start":104.38,"end":106.56,"text":"He is the shortest player ever in the NBA."},{"start":107.06,"end":109.26,"text":"He was born on January 9, 1965."},{"start":110.3,"end":112.4,"text":"He played 14 seasons in the NBA."},{"start":112.95,"end":115.56,"text":"He played about 10 seasons with the Charlotte Hornets."},{"start":115.56,"end":117.14,"text":"He was a point guard."},{"start":117.74,"end":119.94,"text":"A point guard starts the plays and passes the ball."},{"start":119.94,"end":122.7,"text":"Muggsy Bogues was strong at passes and steals."},{"start":123.46,"end":124.34,"text":"He did not need height."},{"start":125,"end":126.8,"text":"He used speed and smart hands."},{"start":127.76,"end":128.94,"text":"Spud Webb was also short."},{"start":129.66,"end":134.38,"text":"He is about 5 feet 7 inches tall, or 1.70 meters."},{"start":135.5,"end":138.04,"text":"He was born on July 13, 1963."},{"start":139.02,"end":141.18,"text":"He was a point guard, like Muggsy Bogues."},{"start":141.66,"end":143.74,"text":"He played for the Atlanta Hawks and other teams."},{"start":144.6,"end":148.24,"text":"In 1986, Spud Webb won the NBA Slam Dunk Contest."},{"start":149,"end":151.24,"text":"A short man beat the tall players at jumping."},{"start":151.8,"end":154,"text":"So two short stars show two paths."},{"start":154,"end":157.14,"text":"Muggsy Bogues used skill, passes, and steals."},{"start":158.22,"end":160.24,"text":"Spud Webb used big jumps and dunks."},{"start":160.88,"end":162.34,"text":"Both worked hard every day."},{"start":162.74,"end":166.04,"text":"Both used Mamba Mentality before the name existed."}],"words":[{"text":"Kobe","start":0,"end":0.26},{"text":"Bryant","start":0.26,"end":0.58},{"text":"was","start":0.58,"end":0.76},{"text":"a","start":0.76,"end":0.92},{"text":"famous","start":0.92,"end":1.18},{"text":"basketball","start":1.18,"end":1.62},{"text":"player","start":1.62,"end":2.02},{"text":"He","start":2.6,"end":2.62},{"text":"was","start":2.62,"end":2.76},{"text":"born","start":2.76,"end":2.94},{"text":"on","start":2.94,"end":3.2},{"text":"August","start":3.2,"end":3.36},{"text":"23","start":3.36,"end":4.12},{"text":"1978","start":4.12,"end":4.76},{"text":"He","start":5.54,"end":5.66},{"text":"played","start":5.66,"end":5.96},{"text":"for","start":5.96,"end":6.22},{"text":"the","start":6.22,"end":6.34},{"text":"Los","start":6.34,"end":6.52},{"text":"Angeles","start":6.52,"end":7.04},{"text":"Lakers","start":7.04,"end":7.36},{"text":"The","start":8.2,"end":8.34},{"text":"Los","start":8.34,"end":8.48},{"text":"Angeles","start":8.48,"end":8.92},{"text":"Lakers","start":8.92,"end":9.18},{"text":"are","start":9.18,"end":9.44},{"text":"a","start":9.44,"end":9.6},{"text":"team","start":9.6,"end":9.76},{"text":"in","start":9.76,"end":9.92},{"text":"the","start":9.92,"end":10.02},{"text":"NBA","start":10.02,"end":10.34},{"text":"The","start":10.98,"end":11.1},{"text":"NBA","start":11.1,"end":11.4},{"text":"is","start":11.4,"end":11.68},{"text":"the","start":11.68,"end":11.84},{"text":"big","start":11.84,"end":12.04},{"text":"basketball","start":12.04,"end":12.5},{"text":"le